#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "cimag, cimagf, cimagl - get imaginary part of a complex number"
msgstr ""
"cimag, cimagf, cimagl - Bestimmung des Imaginärteils einer komplexen Zahl"

